# ─── Exceptii: acestea TREBUIE sa ajunga pe GitHub ────────────────────
# FFmpeg livrat cu aplicatia (urmarit prin Git LFS, vezi .gitattributes)
!assets/bin/windows/SOURCE-FFMPEG.txt
!assets/icon.svg

# FFmpeg is fetched, not committed. The pair is ~194 MB and changes only when
# tools_fetch_ffmpeg.py pins a new version; keeping it in the repository would spend the
# Git LFS bandwidth allowance on every clone and every CI run. Run
# `python tools_fetch_ffmpeg.py` once after cloning; CI runs it before every build.
assets/bin/windows/ffmpeg.exe
assets/bin/windows/ffprobe.exe
assets/bin/windows/LICENSE-FFMPEG.txt
